### PHASE 6 — Terrain Lookahead in State Vector (15->18)
Priority: LOW-MEDIUM | Risk: MEDIUM (input_size changes)
===========================================================================

Step 6.1 — Add query_ground_height() to CreatureEnv in src/environment.py:

    def query_ground_height(self, world_x):
        hits = self.space.segment_query(
            (world_x, 300), (world_x, 600), 1.0, pymunk.ShapeFilter()
        )
        if hits:
            return min(h.point.y for h in hits)
        return 500.0

Step 6.2 — Extend get_state() return array to 18 elements:
  Append after cpg_cos:
    torso_x = self.torso.position.x
    look1 = (self.query_ground_height(torso_x + 50)  - 500.0) * 0.02
    look2 = (self.query_ground_height(torso_x + 100) - 500.0) * 0.02
    look3 = (self.query_ground_height(torso_x + 150) - 500.0) * 0.02
  Add look1, look2, look3 as last 3 elements of the np.array.

Step 6.3 — In src/model.py change: input_size=18 as default.

Step 6.4 — Delete checkpoints:
  Run: Remove-Item models\*.pth -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue

Step 6.5 — Verify:
  Same smoke test as Phase 5 plus: print('state shape:', s.shape)
  Expected: state shape: (18,), action shape: (5,)

