### PHASE 7 — SSE Delta-State Streaming
Priority: LOW | Risk: LOW
===========================================================================

Step 7.1 — In app.py stream_simulation() generate() function:
  Before while loop add:
    prev_frame = {}

  At top of while loop body add:
    frame_start = time.perf_counter()

  Replace yield line with:
    if not prev_frame:
        payload = {"type": "full"}
        payload.update(frame)
    else:
        delta = {k: v for k, v in frame.items() if v != prev_frame.get(k)}
        delta["type"] = "delta"
        delta["steps"] = frame["steps"]
        payload = delta
    prev_frame = frame.copy()
    if done:
        prev_frame = {}
    yield "data: " + json.dumps(payload) + "\n\n"
    frame_end = time.perf_counter()
    time.sleep(max(0.0, (1.0 / 45.0) - (frame_end - frame_start)))

  Remove the old time.sleep(1.0 / 45.0) line.

Step 7.2 — Update EventSource onmessage handler in templates/index.html:
  Read the file first to find the exact handler location.
  Replace the handler body with:
    const data = JSON.parse(event.data);
    if (data.type === 'full') { window.simState = data; }
    else { Object.assign(window.simState || {}, data); }
  Use window.simState for all canvas rendering.

DONE when: delta frames sent, no visual regression.

