===========================================================================
### PHASE 9 — CONCEPTS.md Vocabulary Update
Priority: LOW | Risk: NONE
===========================================================================

Step 9.1 — Read CONCEPTS.md first, then append these new terms:

  Adaptive CPG
    A Central Pattern Generator whose phase advance rate is modulated by
    a learned NN output (5th motor output), allowing the creature to couple
    stride frequency to terrain slope automatically.

  Perlin Terrain
    Procedurally generated continuous heightmap using 1D Perlin noise.
    Difficulty (amplitude + frequency) increases with x-displacement.
    Replaces hardcoded uphill/downhill segments.

  Tournament Selection (k=3)
    GA parent selection where 3 random individuals compete; highest fitness
    wins. Replaces pure elite sampling to preserve population diversity.

  Terrain Lookahead
    3 additional state features giving ground_y at +50, +100, +150px ahead
    of the torso. Grows state vector from 15 to 18 inputs. Basic
    exteroceptive terrain awareness without camera or LiDAR.

  Delta-State SSE
    SSE frames transmitting only changed fields after the first full frame.
    Reduces stream bandwidth ~40-50% on flat terrain runs.

DONE when: all 5 terms appended.

