## SUCCESS METRICS

After Phases 1-6 complete and 50 generations run:
- Best fitness > 400 (vs ~200-250 on flat terrain before)
- Diversity score > 0.15 (tournament prevents collapse)
- Throughput >= current (adaptive max_steps offsets deeper model cost)
- SSE byte rate drops ~40% on flat segments (Phase 7)
- Smoke test always passes

